Yes, I made those patches for NetHack-De after encountering a long
worm crash for the time.

As a developer I just can't stand to have known crash bugs in my
software. :)

Long worm crash bug fix             http://bilious.homelinux.org/?332
Acid dropping bug fix               http://bilious.homelinux.org/?340
Iron bars hitting bug fix           http://bilious.homelinux.org/?341
Deallocated wielded objects bug fix http://bilious.homelinux.org/?342

The description on bilious details what official bugs these patches
hopefully fix.


I think my favorite bug is C343-100 "Game may crash if thrown potion
hits bars before a monster". Wish for iron bars and a crystal wand
(potions being small objects don't always break at the bars) and throw
the crystal wand at the bars. The game crashes immediately.

There lies some kind of beauty in such a crash.

